        "client_msg_id": "9dab1a9e-4509-475f-8c12-dec9259bdcf1",
        "text": "&gt; Feels like it'd be great \"primer\" material for new members to the community.\n<@UC2A2ARPT>\n\nAgreed.\n\nAlthough, maybe one should consider renaming this group from FoC to FoRM, from Future of Coding to Future of Reprogrammable Machines? The former implies writing Gutenberg-y equations using new-fangled QWERTY quills on new-fangled CPU paper made out of flattened transistors.",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1741600273.087719",
        "parent_user_id": "UJFN50C00",
        "blocks": [
            {
                "type": "rich_text",
                "block_id": "8Ii+v",
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "type": "rich_text_quote",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "Feels like it'd be great \"primer\" material for new members to the community."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "\n"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "user",
                                "user_id": "UC2A2ARPT"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "\n\nAgreed.\n\nAlthough, maybe one should consider renaming this group from FoC to FoRM, from Future of Coding to Future of Reprogrammable Machines? The former implies writing Gutenberg-y equations using new-fangled QWERTY quills on new-fangled CPU paper made out of flattened transistors."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
